{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dataminers takes Minesweeper to the next level and puts you right in the middle of the action: hack the mines around you to advance on the cleared fields. Sounds simple? Dataminers is <strong>easy to learn but hard to master!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself in a variety of game modes with a ton of difficulty settings, level progression and unlockables. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/extras/a86282821ca8c94505b0b3c3ac1e9738.avif?t=1768287461\" width=798 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CAMPAIGN\u00a0</i>offers <strong>procedurally generated operations\u00a0</strong>that require <strong>cross-mission strategies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission targets are protected by increasingly difficult security systems and require the use of items and upgrades to beat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/extras/a8560158db922626c34de8732ac2fa94.avif?t=1768287461\" width=798 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CLASSIC</i> is based on Minesweeper, in which <strong>one mistake ends the game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defuse a given number of mines in the shortest possible time and improve your personal best times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/extras/4d9ceeee0204901d413d71bee8fc461d.avif?t=1768287461\" width=798 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ODYSSEY tests your endurance in a series of level themes inspired by iconic sci-fi movies. <strong>How long can you survive?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/extras/f72b74031688a68a1bff105b0c55d23a.avif?t=1768287461\" width=798 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>ZEN JOURNEY</i> takes you to quiet places where <strong>mistakes have no consequences</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do you know Minesweeper?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If <strong>NO</strong>, don't worry! You will learn the puzzle mechanics of Dataminers in the training center and be ready to go in no time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If <strong>YES</strong>, you are already familiar with the base puzzle mechanics of Dataminers. But Dataminers is more than just another Minesweeper clone: this time <i>You are part of the playing field</i> and each game mode will challenge you with an all new minesweeper-like experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2518490?t=1768287461","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2518490?t=1768287461","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/d93fcde3dcbc30a3b73c8dbf1aa1bef0ebbf0e4a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768287461","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/d93fcde3dcbc30a3b73c8dbf1aa1bef0ebbf0e4a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768287461","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4064820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dataminers takes Minesweeper to the next level and puts you right in the middle of the action: hack the mines around you to advance on the cleared fields. Sounds simple? Dataminers is <strong>easy to learn but hard to master!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself in a variety of game modes with a ton of difficulty settings, level progression and unlockables. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/extras/a86282821ca8c94505b0b3c3ac1e9738.avif?t=1768287461\" width=798 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CAMPAIGN\u00a0</i>offers <strong>procedurally generated operations\u00a0</strong>that require <strong>cross-mission strategies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission targets are protected by increasingly difficult security systems and require the use of items and upgrades to beat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518490/extras/a8560158db922626c34de8732ac2fa94.avif?t=1768287461\" width=798 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CLASSIC</i> is based on Minesweeper, in which <strong>one mistake ends the game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defuse a given number of mines in the shortest possible time and improve your personal best times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class